# Sealkeeper Spire (CIPlay sealkeeper_spire): the dock, the orders, four screechers, the base locker, the generator, the
# status board, the pump tower and its crank, the door tower, three fuses, the fuse board (the spire lights), the
# warning, the spire, the control room, the map, the keypad (2817, a wrong code first), Ines's message, the winch (the
# cable), the cable head, the two switches, RESTORE (SEAL is then dead), the verdict, the descend lever.
island Sealkeeper Spire
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Choice
zone dock
expect step 1
read Sealkeeper's orders
expect step 2
read Milo's crayon card
expect step 3
kill Screecher
expect step 4
open Base locker
wait 3
expect step 5
use generator
expect story power 1
expect step 6
read Network status board
expect step 7
zone pump_tower
expect step 8
use pumpcrank
expect step 9
read Pump log
expect step 10
zone door_tower
expect step 11
use fuseboard
expect story fused 0
open Deck fuse locker
open Tower fuse locker
open Shore fuse locker
wait 3
expect story fuse 3
expect step 12
expect hidden spirelights
use fuseboard
expect shown spirelights
expect shown sklure
expect step 13
read Door warden's warning
expect step 14
read Supply pilot's log
expect step 15
zone sk_deep
air sk_dair
open Archive chest
wait 3
expect step 16
read Archive register
expect step 17
zone spire_stair
expect step 18
zone control
expect step 19
read The Network map
expect step 20
use winch
expect story winched 0
code controlpad 1111 wrong
expect story unlocked 0
code controlpad 2817
expect story unlocked 1
expect step 21
read The Director's confession
expect step 22
read Ines's message
expect step 23
use winch
expect shown cable
expect step 24
zone cable_head
expect step 25
read Two switches
expect step 26
use descend
expect story descended 0
use restore
expect story restorechoice 1
use seal
expect story sealchoice 0
expect shown verdictrestore
expect hidden verdictseal
expect step 27
read The verdict
expect step 28
use descend
expect story descended 1
expect done
